Hi Melissa




Just following up on the below - for which thanks.&nbsp;




It is unclear to me how common knowledge the fact of pre-existing agency agreements is to the team - e.g. I note these are deemed privileged &amp; confidential. I certainly was not aware of them beforehand. There are several; some are GLO specific, others are Pan-Nox
