The purpose of the agency agreement I shared with you serves a very limited purpose - hence the limited individuals listed in Annex A - it is to provide a so-called 'fire-break' between the case leads when taking strategic decisions re the PDD trial and PG
 Board/me to reduce the noise about the champerty allegations. It is also why it has more specific language around reporting.




Attached is a final version which is being executed with LD tonight. It acknowledges that lead solicitor under the GLOs authorises the broader type of delegation referred to in my 1st para.




It is also worth saying that LD is heavily reliant on the work you and the team do. They have no intention and have no ability for this work to be done solely within LD/someone else.&nbsp; &nbsp;




There is a discussion tomorrow at 3.30 with LD about protocols as we move forward - may I suggest you join to ensure ILET is part of the conversation?




Best

Anna&nbsp;



