t I can before I depart the firm (Pan-NOx, Ford, Volvo, British Airways, UEFA and easyJet) and will be in the office on 15 December to hold any meetings required.&nbsp;I will also keep myself abreast of any developments on the litigations such that I am fully versed in any material changes in the event I am able to return to work prior to the 15 December 2025.&nbsp;&nbsp;I note that I presently have 6 days remaining of my holiday entitlement for the year. I would be grateful if this accrued holiday is paid to me in my final salary and that this is confirmed by return.&nbsp;&nbsp;As above, if I am able to return to work prior to the 15 December 2025, then I will certainly endeavour to. I am very mindful of my commitments to my team, and to my clients. In the event I am not fit to return to work before 15 December 2025, I will be present in the office on 15 December 2025 to complete my last working day, bid my colleagues farewell, and handover my equipment.&nbsp;Please confirm this by return.&nbsp;&nbsp;Kind regards,&nbsp;Michael​​​​Michael&nbsp;Burke(He/Him)Partner+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7960&nbsp;032&nbsp;34407960&nbsp;032&nbsp;344&nbsp;"}

